{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Thus.</b> The emissary speaks on behalf of the one who sends him, and he spoke in brief, for the word 'his emissary' is elided, and thus it is: 'Behold, I, His emissary, am striking with the staff that is in my hand.'" "And he said 'that is in my hand,' even though it was in Aaron's hand, for the two of them are equal and partners in the sign."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:23.955486863Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}